{
  "status": "Deployed and live verified on mainnet and testnet",
  "features": [
    "Group Payment replaces Lucky Link as the visible mode name; Equal amount is the default and Random amount remains available.",
    "Equal pools require exact division in token base units: 100 tokens / 10 recipients = 10 tokens each, without rounding away funds.",
    "Anyone and Selected wallets both enforce one share per wallet, with 1 to 100 recipient slots.",
    "Equal shares settle in one claim transaction, with no oracle call or draw fee.",
    "Shared searchable token picker, logos, contract addresses and imports; legacy Lucky V1/V2 claim links and history preserved."
  ],
