  "limits": [
    "One wallet is not proof of one person. Anyone mode can be claimed by people using multiple wallets.",
    "Equal claims require a wallet and MON gas. Random claims additionally require a variable oracle fee and separate draw/collection transactions.",
    "A pool has a fixed amount, quota and expiry. It cannot be topped up or reused as another distribution round.",
    "No mainnet Group pool was funded in this release. The ERC20 live smoke used a testnet demo token with no monetary value; ten distinct equal claims are covered by local contract tests.",
